keel-overlay-syncthing (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: the Syncthing overlay of handbook decision 0050, the
    file replication of the application state of a database pair. Ships
    the unit that runs the binary package as the syncthing user, with
    CAP_CHOWN, CAP_FOWNER and CAP_DAC_OVERRIDE as ambient capabilities,
    so a received file keeps the owner of the application's directory
    (copyOwnershipFromParent) without root, and ProtectSystem=strict with
    ReadWritePaths= on the home. keel adds the replicated paths with a
    drop-in. The manifest declares the listen port 22000 on the mesh and
    the health check that asks the REST API on the loopback. The service
    is installed disabled and stopped, the state of a simple installation
    (decision 0041).

 -- KeelLinux maintainers <admin@keellinux.org>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0000
